# Plugin Hub package excludes (path-prefix match, relative to plugin folder).
#
# web/data holds only the bundled SAMPLE city (planx_manifest.json + layers/*.geojson),
# so the viewer is never empty before the first run. From 1.10.0 every run is written
# to its own folder in the QGIS profile (<profile>/osm_3d_model/runs/), never into
# web/data. The two web/data excludes keep a DEM raster or basemap image left there by
# a pre-1.10 run on a developer checkout out of the package.
#
# docs/ is the GitHub presentation layer. No plugin code opens a file under docs/ (the
# manual is online), so it can stay out of the zip; check again before relying on it
# (docs/TRAPS.md 2.5).
web/data/dem
web/data/basemap
docs
.github
setup.cfg
package.json
tests
__pycache__
*.pyc
